WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:02.040
Every night, you enter a world

00:02.040 --> 00:03.408
that doesn't belong to you.

00:04.481 --> 00:05.640
Tonight,

00:05.640 --> 00:06.681
you're going deeper.

00:08.088 --> 00:09.209
Welcome to Somnia.

00:10.170 --> 00:12.049
Somewhere inside the dream is a

00:12.049 --> 00:13.730
part of yourself. Find it.

00:13.851 --> 00:15.339
Complete what it asks of you.

00:16.555 --> 00:18.347
Then, find your way home.

00:19.029 --> 00:20.949
But dreams hide things. When you

00:20.949 --> 00:21.701
need to see

00:23.382 --> 00:25.135
Lucidity. See the dream.

00:26.265 --> 00:27.665
Seeing where you need to go is

00:27.665 --> 00:29.505
only the beginning. Dreams don't

00:29.505 --> 00:31.385
obey ordinary distance. Neither

00:31.385 --> 00:33.705
should you. Elasticity. Move

00:33.705 --> 00:34.433
through the dream.

00:35.033 --> 00:37.113
And sometimes, the dream fights

00:37.113 --> 00:38.914
back. When something stands between

00:38.914 --> 00:39.786
you and your goal.

00:40.955 --> 00:42.634
Willpower. Act when the dream

00:42.634 --> 00:43.235
resists.

00:45.155 --> 00:47.196
But every choice has a cost. Your

00:47.196 --> 00:48.476
psyche is what you're willing to

00:48.476 --> 00:48.868
risk.

00:49.957 --> 00:53.277
Psyche. One hand. Your life, your

00:53.277 --> 00:53.749
power.

00:55.438 --> 00:57.358
You will fail sometimes, but

00:57.358 --> 00:59.038
that's not the end of the dream.

00:59.038 --> 01:00.926
Find the path and make your move.

01:02.318 --> 01:03.999
Now you know what the dream is.

01:03.999 --> 01:05.391
Let's learn how to navigate it.
